      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Lubben Brothers make their debut in Tulsa! They are excited to perform at one of Oklahoma's newest music and arts destinations, Thelma's Peach, on Friday, October 4th. Doors open at 8 PM with music at 9. Tickets are $10 at the door (no online sales)."
