      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Start your weekend early! The Lubben Brothers perform in Brookhaven for their last Wednesday of the season with more than 10 food trucks of all culinary tastes. Free admission.   Brookhaven's Food Truck Wednesdays are 4th Wednesday of the month April thru October at Blackburn Park from 5pm-8:30pm. G"
