        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "North Florida fans! Meet us in Sopchoppy, near Tallahassee, for a great night of music!  Make it a night out with dinner from the Opry Cafe (open at 5:30 pm), followed by a Lubben Brothers show at 7:00 pm. Tickets are $15 at the door or call: (850)-962-3711."
