      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Enjoy some fall fun, photos, and family friendly activities at this year’s pumpkin patch at Holy Spirit Lutheran Church. The Lubben Brothers will only be playing the patch on October 27th, so come and buy your pumpkins then! We would love to see you there!"
