        "@value": "Come celebrate life with us!  Sponsored by Moody Radio South Florida, this event is a celebration of all things JOYFUL!  Food trucks, hayrides, animal interactions, face painting, dancing, and FUN for all ages! $8 admission at the door; children 5 and under are free!"
      }
